# The fixtures of libwebp-compat: one per line, NAME TOOL SOURCE [ARGS...].  make-fixtures.sh reads it.
# TOOL cwebp: cwebp ARGS SOURCE.pam; enc: fixture-encoder SOURCE.pam with key=value ARGS (libwebp's own API);
# img2webp: img2webp ARGS with SOURCE a comma-separated list of sources (an animation); craft: craft.py ARGS on
# the fixture SOURCE.  Sources are gen-sources.py's KIND-WxH names.  Copyright (C) 2026 Awe Morris; SPDX-License-Identifier: Zlib
